Description: Selviana Desktop Environment - small, fast and modern desktop
 SDE (Selviana Desktop Environment) is a lightweight desktop environment
 developed by the Selviana DE Project, with a Rust configuration core and
 autostart helper, a C++17 interface using FLTK, cairo and Xlib, and a
 source-built SDE WM (Openbox) and SDE compositor (picom). It is built and
 tested on Debian testing.
 .
 This 0.1 Alpha release contains:
  * sde-session  - session manager with crash recovery, rescue dialog,
                   XDG autostart and a system check (sde-session --check)
  * sde-panel    - taskbar, searchable application menu, pinned launchers,
                   quick settings (network, sound, brightness, battery),
                   calendar, XEmbed and StatusNotifierItem tray
  * sde-desktop  - wallpaper and desktop icons
  * sde-notifyd  - desktop notifications with Do Not Disturb
  * sde-settings - the Control Center (also sde-control-center): every
                   setting by category, Users & Avatar (account picture
                   and name), appearance, panel, Start menu, displays,
                   sound, power, network, keyboard and mouse
  * sde-display-settings - native monitor profiles, resolution and scale
  * sde-run      - run command dialog (Alt+F2)
  * sde-logout   - log out, lock, suspend, restart and shut down
  * sde-power    - power manager: battery warnings, lid and power button,
                   idle dimming and suspend, brightness keys with an OSD
  * sde-lock     - screen locker (PAM service sde-lock) with
                   org.freedesktop.ScreenSaver idle inhibitors
  * sde-autostart - Rust XDG autostart launcher with a dry-run diagnostic
 .
 Select "SDE-Desktop" in your display manager to start it. This is an alpha
 release meant for testing; expect missing features.
 .
 Its own ecosystem: SDE-FLTK (the SDE fork of FLTK, linked statically),
 sde-xsettingsd and sde-polkit-agent (written from scratch), and source
 builds of SDE WM (Openbox) and SDE compositor (picom).
 .
 Applications written from scratch by the Selviana DE Project: Niny (text
 editor), Xanara (PDF viewer and editor), Taca (archive manager), Photo,
 Gallery, Calculator, SDE System Monitor, SDE Power and SDE Screen Lock. Source-built
 SDE fork: Liria (Caja).
 These executables and their resources are included in this package;
 no corresponding MATE application packages are required.
 Software Updater (sde-update) uses an attributed mintupdate model, Debian
 PackageKit and Flatpak.

